  "question": {
    "text": "A hyperbola has its centre at the origin, passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and has transverse axis of length <math><mn>4</mn></math> along the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then the eccentricity of the hyperbola is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "DwdBb",
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
