  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of hyperbola having tranverse axis along&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>From the given information, equation of hyperbola can be taken as<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> since <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4853caea-7df2-4a13-a0be-5349a12205bf-image.png\" style=\"width: 296px; height: 258px;\" /><br /><br />Since it passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math><br /><br />Hence <math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
